  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil in a kadai and add the cumin seeds, crushed coriander seeds and dried red chillies for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the onions and cook until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the tomatoes, chilli powder, turmeric and salt and cook until soft and the oil starts to separate.",
    "Add the chicken and sear on high heat for 5 minutes, stirring.",
    "Cover and cook on medium-low heat for 15 minutes until the chicken is nearly done.",
    "Add the capsicum, garam masala and fenugreek leaves and cook uncovered 5 minutes until the masala clings to the chicken.",
    "Garnish with the coriander leaves and serve."
  ]
